MAIN
MOVE TEMP 0 HALLOCATE 0
MOVE TEMP 1 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 QS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 1 4 QS_Sort
HSTORE TEMP 1 8 QS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 1 12 QS_Init
MOVE TEMP 2 HALLOCATE 12
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 QS_Start
