HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
MOVE TEMP 6 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 2 10 ) 
PRINT TEMP 6
END
QS_Start [2]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 12
MOVE TEMP 5 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 1 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 8
MOVE TEMP 8 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 8
PRINT 9999
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 2 MINUS TEMP 9 1
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 4
MOVE TEMP 12 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 0 0 TEMP 2 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 12
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 8
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 14 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 15
RETURN 0
END
